WEBVTT

00:03:27.063 --> 00:03:30.497
So what should we do?

00:03:31.363 --> 00:03:36.463
Instead of canceling people,
we should use the tool called compassion.

00:03:37.297 --> 00:03:40.863
I find the definition of compassion
is a fascinating one.

00:03:40.863 --> 00:03:43.730
And it's not one
that I hear people talk about.

00:03:43.763 --> 00:03:49.697
Compassion means to suffer with someone.

00:03:49.697 --> 00:03:52.963
To suffer alongside them.

00:03:52.997 --> 00:03:54.463
Imagine.

00:03:54.497 --> 00:03:57.097
When someone, say, Grandpa,

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.197
says that thing
that's caused you to decide